./skills/claude/yalla-dokploy-deploy/references/rollback.md:110:| "Revert" | Could mean rollback OR a git revert that the next deploy picks up — disambiguate |
./skills/claude/yalla-dokploy-deploy/references/rollback.md:112:When the user is ambiguous, the safest read is rollback if `.dokploy.yaml.last_deploy.status` is `error` or they mention "broken / bad / hotfix / revert"; otherwise ask.
